---
// Componente Misión y Visión
---

<section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-20 relative z-10">
	<!-- Tarjeta Misión -->
	<div class="group relative bg-[#0D1829]/80 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-8 border border-cyan-500/20 hover:border-cyan-400/60 transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg hover:shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(34,211,238,0.2)] hover:-translate-y-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
		<div>
			<!-- Encabezado de Tarjeta Misión -->
			<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
					<!-- Icono de Bandera -->
					<div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-500/20 group-hover:bg-cyan-500/20 transition-colors">
						<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 21v-4m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6.5l1 1H21l-3 6 3 6h-8.5l-1-1H5a2 2 0 00-2 2zm9-13.5V9"></path>
						</svg>
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-wide">
						Misión
					</h3>
				</div>

				<!-- Icono decorativo Cohete (top right) -->
				<div class="text-cyan-400/40 group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">
					<svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
						<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M15.59 14.37a6 6 0 01-5.84 7.38v-4.8m5.84-2.58a14.98 14.98 0 006.16-12.12A14.98 14.98 0 009.631 8.41m5.96 5.96a14.926 14.926 0 01-5.841 2.58m-.119-8.54a6 6 0 00-7.381 5.84h4.8m2.581-5.84a14.927 14.927 0 00-2.58 5.84m2.58-5.84l4.24-4.24"></path>
					</svg>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Texto descriptivo Misión -->
			<p class="text-gray-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
				Fomentar el estudio, investigación y aplicación ética de la Inteligencia Artificial, proporcionando un entorno colaborativo donde profesionales, académicos y estudiantes puedan desarrollar proyectos de alto impacto tecnológico y social.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>

	<!-- Tarjeta Visión -->
	<div class="group relative bg-[#0D1829]/80 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-8 border border-cyan-500/20 hover:border-cyan-400/60 transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg hover:shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(34,211,238,0.2)] hover:-translate-y-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
		<div>
			<!-- Encabezado de Tarjeta Visión -->
			<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
					<!-- Icono de Globo / Mundo -->
					<div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-500/20 group-hover:bg-cyan-500/20 transition-colors">
						<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
							<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3.6 9h16.8M3.6 15h16.8M12 3a15.3 15.3 0 014 9 15.3 15.3 0 01-4 9 15.3 15.3 0 01-4-9 15.3 15.3 0 014-9z"></path>
						</svg>
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-wide">
						Visión
					</h3>
				</div>

				<!-- Icono decorativo Ojo (top right) -->
				<div class="text-cyan-400/40 group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">
					<svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
						<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path>
						<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z"></path>
					</svg>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Texto descriptivo Visión -->
			<p class="text-gray-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
				Ser la organización referente en Latinoamérica en el avance científico y tecnológico de la Inteligencia Artificial, liderando la convergencia entre la academia, la industria y la sociedad para un futuro impulsado por IA responsable.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
